  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1705506399_9091233_e4eed8d10e071964b2b060b145f89db4.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our brand is JVERNY,We strive to redefine the boundaries of style, offering a diverse range of clothing that caters to the modern woman's dynamic lifestyle.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Explore our chic dresses &ndash; a fusion of sophistication and contemporary allure. From day-to-night ensembles, each piece is crafted for comfort and designed to make a statement. Redefine your style with Jverny.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">From casual day dresses to glamorous evening wear, our collection is thoughtfully designed to complement various tastes and occasions. Each piece is crafted with precision, attention to detail, and a commitment to quality, ensuring that you not only look stunning but also feel comfortable in every ensemble.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Payment terms:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Pay with major credit cards (Visa, MasterCard, American Express) or choose secure options like PayPal. Experience convenient and flexible transactions at Jverny.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Shipping:</strong> Worldwide delivery brings J. Verny to your doorstep. Transparent rates and delivery times provided at checkout.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Returns and Exchanges:</strong> Shop worry-free. Hassle-free returns and exchanges within the specified period.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Customer Support:</strong> Need assistance? Email <a target=\"_new\">service@jverny.com</a> for prompt help, styling advice, or any inquiries. Your satisfaction is our priority.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>",
